---
const items = [
  ["An AI coding agent", "Claude Code, Codex, Cursor or similar. Any plan or usage cost is separate from the kit."],
  ["A computer that can render", "Windows, macOS or Linux, with Node.js 18+, ffmpeg and Python 3.10 to 3.14. The doctor command installs what it can and prints the rest."],
  ["Comfort pasting into a terminal", "You will not edit video, but you will run an agent in a project folder."],
  ["Your own music, if you want it", "Not included. Without tracks, reels are voice only."],
  ["Time for first-run downloads", "Whisper's model is about 480 MB. Fonts and browser download once."],
  ["Remotion's licence, for bigger teams", "Companies of four or more need a Remotion company licence."],
]
---

<div class="req">
  <p class="kicker">// before you buy. there are no refunds, so check this first</p>
  <ul>
    {
      items.map(([title, note]) => (
        <li>
          <span class="box" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <p>
            <b>{title}.</b> {note}
          </p>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .req {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 11px;
  }
  li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr;
    gap: 11px;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.38;
  }
  li p {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  li b {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .box {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    margin-top: 1px;
    border: 2px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
</style>
